### Test AI Recommendation Endpoint

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@patientToken = your_patient_jwt_token_here

# First, signup/login as a patient to get a token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testpatient@example.com",
  "username": "testpatient",
  "password": "TestPassword123",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "middle_name": "Michael",
  "phone": "+2348012345678",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-01-15",
  "sex": "Male",
  "address": "Lagos, Nigeria",
  "role": "patient"
}

### Test AI Recommendation with patient symptoms
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": "I have been experiencing severe chest pain for the past 3 days. The pain is sharp and worsens when I breathe deeply. I also feel short of breath and have mild fever. I have a history of high blood pressure in my family."
}

### Test with different symptoms
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": "My child has been running a fever for 5 days with a rash all over the body. The baby is 2 months old and refuses to feed. Fever reduces with paracetamol but comes back after 4 hours."
}

### Test error case - Missing symptoms
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": ""
}

### Test error case - Missing authorization
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptoms": "I have chest pain"
}
